-- agent — программа-агент для Acer: слушает команды по UDP (10.0.0.2:5555 по
-- кабелю и адрес по DHCP в Wi-Fi), принимает программы по порту 5556,
-- запускает их, держит полку на диске. Wi-Fi: посылка прошивки лежит в
-- \SALTIC\FIRMWARE\QCA9377.BIN (команда wifi-keep), при старте агент
-- грузит её в причал и подключается к открытой сети WIFI_NETWORK; ответ уходит
-- тем же входом, откуда пришла команда (via).
-- Только x86_64-uefi; куча 1073741824. Никогда не выходит. Команды — реестр
-- agent.commands; на том же порту — mRPC/1.0 (пакет-объект JSON, network.mrpc).
-- Agent — всё состояние цикла; card.base — guest_base. Ответ на команду —
-- текст до REPLY_LIMIT байт плюс вывод запущенной программы (reply.*).
--
-- Agent { card, frames, commands, arp, expected, received, total, columns,
--     rows, line, cursor, console, shown_second, rounds, failures, last_error,
--     shot_bytes, restart, output, lent, bay, bay_pages, names, chosen, limit,
--     linked, opening, saver, active_at, wifi, wifi_text, via }
-- my_ip(agent) -> наш IP на входе via / transmit(agent, frame) — кадр в via
-- wifi_up(agent, name) -> текст — прошивка с диска в причал, qca9377.bring_up;
--     greet по Wi-Fi / wifi_keep(agent) -> текст — посылку из причала на диск
-- poll_wifi(agent) — до WIFI_FRAMES кадров из Wi-Fi в handle с via = wifi
-- day_second(base) -> секунда суток / wake(agent) -> yes, если снят хранитель;
--     отмечает активность / doze(agent) — хранитель после SAVER_AFTER секунд простоя
-- log(agent, message) — в консоль, пока console = yes
-- begin_upload / upload_state / launch / keep_program / open_by_word /
--     memory_dump / prepare_disk / install_image / time_reply / show_code /
--     device_list / information / draw_test / clear_screen / home_state /
--     print_line / restart_later(agent[, words|payload]) -> текст ответа команды
-- execute(agent, text, payload) -> текст — разбор команды по первому слову
-- key_reply(base, text) -> текст — нажатия в очередь keys (их читает press)
-- mrpc_reply(agent, packet) -> байты ответа mRPC: help/describe, info —
--     полями (info_fields), иначе текст команды из реестра → execute
-- Info { mac, ip, … } / gather(agent) -> Info — что знает о себе агент;
--     information(agent) -> текст / info_fields(info) -> члены mrpc.data
-- link_russian(status) -> текст линка / has_link(card) -> yes/no
-- refresh_shelf(agent) / open_program(agent) / press(agent, key) — полка и клавиши
-- answer(agent, bytes) -> agent — UDP-команда или кусок shot; команда и ответ —
--     ещё и в netlog, панель внизу экрана
-- store_chunk(agent, bytes) -> agent — кусок программы в bay, ответ "ok N"
-- handle(agent, bytes) -> agent — ARP или UDP по портам
-- greet(card) / watch_link(agent) / last_cry(card, message) — сеть и баннеры
-- wait_second(base) / countdown(agent, seconds) — отсчёт перед перезагрузкой
-- draw_progress(agent) — полоса приёма, если экран наш
-- tick(agent) — один круг: кадры, клавиши раз в KEY_EVERY, часы и системная
--     панель раз в CLOCK_EVERY
-- survive(agent) — tick с перехватом сбоя / serve(agent) — вечный цикл
-- take_bay(agent, bytes) — причал под программу: до участка арены "bay" —
--     он, больше — страницы в окне агента ровно по размеру; свои страницы того
--     же размера остаются на месте (snippet.py узнаёт адрес до сборки), иные
--     отдаются; NoUploadRoom / trim_bay(agent, size) — отдать хвост
-- run() — открыть карту, линк, проверить arena_map, serve; причал — по заливке
-- program() — вход: run с баннером при сбое, затем вечное ожидание

use io
use core.num
use core.str
use core.group
use core.mem
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.firmware
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.arena_map
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.pci
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.drivers.rtl8111
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.drivers.qca9377
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.drivers.qca9377.traffic
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.network.net
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.uefi
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.screen.graphics
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.screen.lettering
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.storage.files
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.storage.disk
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.clock
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.parse
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.screen.spider
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.drivers.usb
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.agent.feed
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.drivers.camera
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.network.shot
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.network.reply
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.network.netlog
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.screen.system_panel
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.agent.programs
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.agent.shelf
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.agent.saver
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.agent.commands
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.keys
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.network.mrpc
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.network.mrpc.data
use os.target.uefi_x86_64.platform.utf8

VERSION = 17
KEY_EVERY = 256
ENTER = 13
SCAN_RIGHT = 3
SCAN_LEFT = 4
REPLY_LIMIT = 1400
PORT = 5555
DATA_PORT = 5556
UPLOAD_LIMIT = 33554432
PAGE_BYTES = 4096
REPORT_EVERY = 32768
MY_IP = [10, 0, 0, 2]
WIFI_NETWORK = "POCO X6 Pro 5G"
WIFI_FOLDER = "FIRMWARE"
WIFI_FILE = "QCA9377.BIN"
WIFI_EVERY = 8
WIFI_FRAMES = 4
WIFI_ROOM = 1048576

Agent = Box {
    card = rtl8111.Card {},
    frames = 0,
    commands = 0,
    arp = 0,
    expected = 0,
    received = 0,
    total = 0,
    columns = 0,
    rows = 0,
    line = 0,
    cursor = 0,
    console = yes,
    shown_second = -1,
    rounds = 0,
    failures = 0,
    last_error = "нет",
    shot_bytes = 0,
    restart = no,
    output = [],
    lent = no,
    bay = 0,
    bay_pages = 0,
    names = [],
    chosen = 0,
    limit = 0,
    linked = no,
    opening = "",
    saver = no,
    active_at = 0,
    wifi = none,
    wifi_text = "выключен",
    via = "cable"
}

COUNTDOWN = 5
SECOND_WAIT = 50000000
SHOT_PREFIX = "shot-part "
CLOCK_EVERY = 20000
SAVER_AFTER = 60
DAY_SECONDS = 86400
ERASE_WORD = "ERASE-ACER-DISK"

skill log(agent, message) {
    (agent.console == yes) { io.show(message) }
    out none
}

skill take_bay(agent, bytes) {
    @base = agent.card.base
    @spare = arena_map.region("bay")
    @pages = (bytes + PAGE_BYTES - 1) / PAGE_BYTES
    (bytes > spare.bytes) {
        (agent.bay_pages == pages) { out none }
    }
    (agent.bay_pages > 0) {
        uefi.free_pages(base, agent.bay, agent.bay_pages)
        agent.bay_pages = 0
    }
    agent.bay = firmware.region(base, "bay")
    (bytes <= spare.bytes) { out none }
    @place = uefi.pages_in_window(base, pages) rescue |err| { out error.NoUploadRoom }
    agent.bay = place
    agent.bay_pages = pages
    out none
}

skill trim_bay(agent, size) {
    @keep = (size + PAGE_BYTES - 1) / PAGE_BYTES
    (agent.bay_pages > keep) {
        uefi.free_pages(agent.card.base, firmware.add(agent.bay, keep * PAGE_BYTES), agent.bay_pages - keep)
        agent.bay_pages = keep
    }
    out none
}

skill begin_upload(agent, words) {
    (group.count(words) < 2) { out "как: upload <байт>" }
    @size = parse.parse_size(group.get(words, 1))
    (size < 1) { out "плохой размер" }
    (size > agent.limit) {
        @limit = agent.limit
        out "слишком много: предел {limit} байт"
    }
    agent.expected = 0
    take_bay(agent, size) rescue |err| { out "нет памяти под {size} байт" }
    agent.expected = size
    agent.received = 0
    agent.total = 0
    log(agent, "upload: waiting for {size} bytes on port 5556")
    out "жду {size} байт на порту 5556"
}

skill upload_state(agent) {
    @received = agent.received
    @expected = agent.expected
    @total = agent.total
    out "принято {received} из {expected} байт, сумма {total}"
}

skill launch(agent) {
    (agent.expected == 0) { out "ничего не принято" }
    ((agent.received == agent.expected) == no) { out str.concat("приём не закончен: ", upload_state(agent)) }
    @size = agent.expected
    log(agent, "run: starting uploaded image, {size} bytes")
    system_panel.flush(agent.card.base, agent.card) rescue |err| { none }
    @launched = uefi.start_image(agent.card.base, agent.bay, size)
    agent.output = launched.output
    agent.lent = yes
    @outcome = launched.outcome
    @code = outcome.value
    @status = "{code}"
    (outcome.failed == yes) { status = "ошибка прошивки {code}" }
    log(agent, "run: image returned")
    rtl8111.configure(agent.card)
    rtl8111.wait_link(agent.card) rescue |err| { none }
    agent.linked = has_link(agent.card)
    log(agent, "run: card configured again, listening")
    agent.active_at = day_second(agent.card.base)
    (outcome.failed == no) {
        (code == reply.HOME) { clear_screen(agent) }
    }
    out "программа закончила работу, статус {status}"
}

skill memory_dump(agent, words) {
    (group.count(words) < 2) { out "как: mem <адрес hex> [байт]" }
    @at = parse.parse_hex(group.get(words, 1)) rescue |err| { out "плохой адрес: {err}" }
    @count = parse.MEMORY_DEFAULT
    (group.count(words) > 2) { count = parse.parse_count(group.get(words, 2)) }
    @dump = []
    @row = ""
    drum (count) {
        (num.mod(beat, 16) == 0) {
            (beat > 0) { dump = group.add(dump, row) }
            @where = firmware.phys_text(firmware.add(at, beat))
            row = "{where}:"
        }
        @value = firmware.hex(firmware.read8(at, agent.card.base, beat), 2)
        row = "{row} {value}"
    }
    dump = group.add(dump, row)
    out str.join(dump, "\n")
}

skill link_russian(status) {
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_LINK) == no) { out "нет" }
    @speed = "?"
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_10) == yes) { speed = "10" }
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_100) == yes) { speed = "100" }
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_1000) == yes) { speed = "1000" }
    @duplex = "полудуплекс"
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_FULL_DUPLEX) == yes) { duplex = "полный дуплекс" }
    out "есть, {speed} Мбит/с, {duplex}"
}

Info = Box {
    mac = "",
    ip = "",
    arena = "",
    bay = "",
    held = 0,
    limit = 0,
    link = "",
    up = no,
    mbps = 0,
    full = no,
    frames = 0,
    handled = 0,
    arp = 0,
    columns = 0,
    rows = 0,
    failures = 0,
    last_error = "",
    wifi = ""
}

skill gather(agent) {
    @status = rtl8111.status(agent.card)
    @mbps = 0
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_10) == yes) { mbps = 10 }
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_100) == yes) { mbps = 100 }
    (rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_1000) == yes) { mbps = 1000 }
    out Info {
        mac = net.mac_text(agent.card.mac),
        ip = net.ip_text(MY_IP),
        arena = firmware.phys_text(firmware.arena(agent.card.base)),
        bay = firmware.phys_text(agent.bay),
        held = agent.bay_pages * PAGE_BYTES / 1024,
        limit = agent.limit,
        link = link_russian(status),
        up = rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_LINK),
        mbps = mbps,
        full = rtl8111.has_bit(status, rtl8111.PHY_FULL_DUPLEX),
        frames = agent.frames,
        handled = agent.commands,
        arp = agent.arp,
        columns = agent.columns,
        rows = agent.rows,
        failures = agent.failures,
        last_error = agent.last_error,
        wifi = wifi_line(agent)
    }
}

skill information(agent) {
    @info = gather(agent)
    out "агент Saltic {VERSION} на Acer Aspire E5-575G\nmac {info.mac}, ip {info.ip}, udp-порт 5555\nлинк {info.link}\nWi-Fi {info.wifi}\nарена DMA {info.arena}, приём программ {info.bay}, своих страниц {info.held} КБ, предел {info.limit} байт\nкадров {info.frames}, команд {info.handled}, ответов ARP {info.arp}\nэкран {info.columns} × {info.rows} символов\nсбоев в цикле {info.failures}, последний: {info.last_error}"
}

skill info_fields(info) {
    @duplex = "half"
    (info.full == yes) { duplex = "full" }
    @link = [data.answer("up", info.up), data.number("mbps", info.mbps), data.text("duplex", duplex)]
    @screen = [data.number("columns", info.columns), data.number("rows", info.rows)]
    out [
        data.number("agent", VERSION),
        data.text("mac", info.mac),
        data.text("ip", info.ip),
        data.object("link", link),
        data.text("arena", info.arena),
        data.text("bay", info.bay),
        data.number("bay_kb", info.held),
        data.number("limit", info.limit),
        data.number("frames", info.frames),
        data.number("commands", info.handled),
        data.number("arp", info.arp),
        data.object("screen", screen),
        data.number("failures", info.failures),
        data.text("last_error", info.last_error),
        data.text("wifi", info.wifi)
    ]
}

skill draw_test(agent) {
    @screen = graphics.open(agent.card.base)
    @gray = graphics.color(screen, 161, 161, 170)
    @left = (screen.width - 400) / 2
    @top = (screen.height - 260) / 2
    graphics.fill(screen, left - 4, top - 4, 408, 208, graphics.color(screen, 250, 250, 250))
    graphics.fill(screen, left, top, 400, 200, gray)
    graphics.fill(screen, left, top + 220, 120, 40, graphics.color(screen, 239, 68, 68))
    graphics.fill(screen, left + 140, top + 220, 120, 40, graphics.color(screen, 34, 197, 94))
    graphics.fill(screen, left + 280, top + 220, 120, 40, graphics.color(screen, 59, 130, 246))
    @width = screen.width
    @height = screen.height
    @stride = screen.stride
    @format = graphics.format_name(screen)
    @frame = firmware.phys_text(screen.frame)
    out "графика: {width} × {height}, формат {format}, строка {stride} пикселей, кадр по адресу {frame}\nнарисовал серый прямоугольник 400 × 200 и красный, зелёный, синий квадраты"
}

skill clear_screen(agent) {
    @screen = graphics.open(agent.card.base)
    graphics.fill(screen, 0, 0, screen.width, screen.height, feed.paper(screen))
    feed.draw_header(agent, VERSION, "10.0.0.2:5555")
    agent.line = 0
    agent.cursor = feed.TOP
    agent.console = no
    agent.lent = no
    refresh_shelf(agent)
    netlog.draw(agent.card.base) rescue |err| { none }
    system_panel.draw(agent.card.base, agent.card) rescue |err| { none }
    out "экран очищен"
}

skill refresh_shelf(agent) {
    agent.names = programs.shelf_names(agent.card.base) rescue |err| { [] }
    (agent.chosen >= group.count(agent.names)) { agent.chosen = 0 }
    out shelf.draw_shelf(agent.card.base, agent.names, agent.chosen)
}

skill keep_program(agent, words) {
    (group.count(words) < 2) { out "как: keep <имя>" }
    (agent.expected == 0) { out "ничего не принято" }
    @name = group.get(words, 1)
    @written = programs.keep(agent.card.base, agent.bay, agent.expected, name)
    system_panel.measure_disk(agent.card.base) rescue |err| { none }
    (agent.lent == no) { refresh_shelf(agent) }
    out "сохранил {name}: {written} байт в \\SALTIC\\BIN"
}

skill home_state(agent) {
    @shelf_list = str.join(agent.names, ", ")
    @chosen = "нет"
    (group.count(agent.names) > 0) { chosen = group.get(agent.names, agent.chosen) }
    @link = link_russian(rtl8111.status(agent.card))
    out "главный экран агента {VERSION}; программы в панели: {shelf_list}; выбрана: {chosen}; линк: {link}"
}

skill open_by_word(agent, words) {
    (group.count(words) < 2) { out "как: open <имя>" }
    @wanted = str.upper(group.get(words, 1))
    drum (group.count(agent.names)) {
        (group.get(agent.names, beat) == wanted) {
            agent.chosen = beat
            agent.opening = wanted
            out "открываю {wanted}"
        }
    }
    @known = str.join(agent.names, ", ")
    out "нет программы {wanted} в панели; есть: {known}"
}

skill open_program(agent) {
    (group.count(agent.names) == 0) { out none }
    @name = group.get(agent.names, agent.chosen)
    agent.expected = 0
    take_bay(agent, agent.limit)
    @size = programs.load(agent.card.base, name, agent.bay, agent.limit)
    trim_bay(agent, size)
    agent.expected = size
    agent.received = size
    feed.show_command(agent, "клавиатура", feed.text_bytes("открываю {name}", 64))
    @result = launch(agent)
    out feed.show_reply(agent, feed.text_bytes(result, 200))
}

skill day_second(base) {
    @moment = uefi.now(base)
    out moment.hour * 3600 + moment.minute * 60 + moment.second
}

skill wake(agent) {
    agent.active_at = day_second(agent.card.base)
    (agent.saver == no) { out no }
    agent.saver = no
    clear_screen(agent)
    out yes
}

skill doze(agent) {
    @idle = num.mod(day_second(agent.card.base) - agent.active_at + DAY_SECONDS, DAY_SECONDS)
    (idle < SAVER_AFTER) { out none }
    agent.saver = yes
    out saver.draw(agent.card.base, VERSION)
}

skill press(agent, key) {
    (key.ready == no) { out none }
    (wake(agent) == yes) { out none }
    (agent.lent == yes) { out clear_screen(agent) }
    @count = group.count(agent.names)
    (count == 0) { out none }
    (key.scan == SCAN_RIGHT) { agent.chosen = num.mod(agent.chosen + 1, count) }
    (key.scan == SCAN_LEFT) { agent.chosen = num.mod(agent.chosen + count - 1, count) }
    (key.char == ENTER) { out open_program(agent) rescue |err| { feed.show_reply(agent, feed.text_bytes("не открылась: {err}", 200)) } }
    out shelf.draw_shelf(agent.card.base, agent.names, agent.chosen)
}

skill print_line(agent, line_bytes) {
    feed.print_big(agent, line_bytes)
    agent.line = agent.line + 1
    out "напечатал строку {agent.line}"
}

skill prepare_disk(agent, words) {
    @base = agent.card.base
    @target = disk.find_target(base, files.handles_with(base, files.BY_PROTOCOL, files.BLOCK_IO_GUID), files.BLOCK_IO_GUID)
    @size = target.megabytes
    (group.count(words) < 2) { out "будет стёрт целый несъёмный диск, около {size} МБ. Чтобы стереть и разметить: prepare-disk {ERASE_WORD}" }
    ((group.get(words, 1) == ERASE_WORD) == no) { out "кодовое слово не то, ничего не записано" }
    log(agent, "disk: erasing {size} MB disk, writing GPT")
    disk.write_table(base, target)
    log(agent, "disk: writing FAT32")
    disk.write_fat(base, target)
    disk.reconnect(base, target)
    out str.concat("диск размечен: GPT, раздел EFI 512 МБ, FAT32 'SALTIC'\n", files.report(base))
}

skill install_image(agent) {
    (agent.expected == 0) { out "сначала upload программы" }
    ((agent.received == agent.expected) == no) { out str.concat("приём не закончен: ", upload_state(agent)) }
    @written = files.install(agent.card.base, agent.bay, agent.expected)
    system_panel.measure_disk(agent.card.base) rescue |err| { none }
    out "записал \\EFI\\BOOT\\BOOTX64.EFI на том SALTIC: {written} байт"
}

skill time_reply(agent) {
    @moment = clock.local_time(uefi.now(agent.card.base))
    @moment_text = clock.clock_text(moment)
    @date = clock.date_text(moment)
    out "{date} {moment_text} (UTC+5, по часам ноутбука)"
}

skill show_code(agent, payload) {
    @lines = feed.split_lines(group.slice(payload, 5, group.count(payload)))
    @count = group.count(lines)
    feed.show_code(agent, group.slice(payload, 5, group.count(payload)))
    out "показал кусок: {count} строк"
}

skill device_list(agent) {
    @base = agent.card.base
    out str.join(pci.device_lines(base, firmware.ecam(base)), "\n")
}

skill execute(agent, text, payload) {
    @words = str.split(text, " ")
    @name = group.get(words, 0)
    (name == "help") { out commands.help_text() }
    (name == "info") { out information(agent) }
    (name == "pci") { out device_list(agent) }
    (name == "mem") { out memory_dump(agent, words) }
    (name == "echo") { out str.slice(text, 4, str.bytes(text)) }
    (name == "upload") { out begin_upload(agent, words) }
    (name == "check") { out upload_state(agent) }
    (name == "run") { out launch(agent) }
    (name == "screen") { out draw_test(agent) }
    (name == "clear") { out clear_screen(agent) }
    (name == "volumes") { out files.report(agent.card.base) }
    (name == "usb") { out usb.report(agent.card.base) }
    (name == "code") { out show_code(agent, payload) }
    (name == "keep") { out keep_program(agent, words) }
    (name == "open") { out open_by_word(agent, words) }
    (name == "state") { out home_state(agent) }
    (name == "camera") { out camera.report(agent.card.base) }
    (name == "protocols") { out usb.protocols(agent.card.base, words) }
    (name == "time") { out time_reply(agent) }
    (name == "key") { out key_reply(agent.card.base, str.slice(text, 4, str.bytes(text))) }
    (name == "reboot") { out restart_later(agent) }
    (name == "shot") {
        @taken = shot.capture(agent.card) rescue |err| { out "снимок не сделан: {err} (участок shot — половина экрана до 1920 × 1080)" }
        agent.shot_bytes = taken
        out shot.caption(agent.card, agent.shot_bytes)
    }
    (name == "prepare-disk") { out prepare_disk(agent, words) }
    (name == "install") { out install_image(agent) }
    (name == "wifi") {
        @network = WIFI_NETWORK
        (group.count(words) > 1) { network = str.slice(text, 5, str.bytes(text)) }
        out wifi_up(agent, network)
    }
    (name == "wifi-keep") { out wifi_keep(agent) }
    (name == "print") { out print_line(agent, group.slice(payload, 6, group.count(payload))) }
    @help = commands.help_text()
    out "не знаю команду '{name}'. {help}"
}

skill mrpc_reply(agent, packet) {
    @started = day_second(agent.card.base)
    @call = mrpc.decode(packet.text)
    @registry = commands.REGISTRY
    (call.ok == no) { out mrpc.failure(call, "invalid_param", call.message, "", 0) }
    (call.cmd == "help") { out mrpc.help(call, registry, 0, REPLY_LIMIT) }
    (call.cmd == "describe") { out mrpc.describe(call, registry, 0) }
    (call.cmd == "info") { out data.reply(call, info_fields(gather(agent)), 0) }
    @command = mrpc.find(registry, call.cmd)
    (command == none) { out mrpc.unknown(call, registry, 0) }
    @line = mrpc.line(call, command)
    (line.ok == no) { out mrpc.failure(call, "missing_param", "нужен параметр {line.param}", line.param, 0) }
    @said = execute(agent, line.text, utf8.encode(line.text)) rescue |err| {
        @spent = num.mod(day_second(agent.card.base) - started + DAY_SECONDS, DAY_SECONDS) * 1000
        out mrpc.failure(call, "internal", "{err}", "", spent)
    }
    @bytes = utf8.encode(said)
    (group.count(agent.output) > 0) { bytes = group.concat(group.add(bytes, 10), agent.output) }
    agent.output = []
    @ms = num.mod(day_second(agent.card.base) - started + DAY_SECONDS, DAY_SECONDS) * 1000
    out mrpc.success(call, bytes, ms, REPLY_LIMIT)
}

skill key_reply(base, text) {
    @count = keys.push(base, text) rescue |err| { out "клавиша не принята: {err}" }
    out "принято нажатий: {count}"
}

skill wait_second(base) {
    @first = uefi.now(base)
    drum (SECOND_WAIT) {
        @moment = uefi.now(base)
        ((moment.second == first.second) == no) { out none }
    }
    out none
}

skill countdown(agent, seconds) {
    @base = agent.card.base
    drum (seconds) {
        @left = seconds - beat
        feed.banner(base, "перезагрузка через {left}...")
        wait_second(base)
    }
    feed.banner(base, "перезагружаюсь")
    out none
}

skill restart_later(agent) {
    agent.restart = yes
    out "перезагружаюсь через {COUNTDOWN} секунд"
}

skill answer(agent, bytes) {
    @packet = net.udp(bytes)
    (str.starts_with(packet.text, SHOT_PREFIX) == yes) {
        (agent.via == "wifi") { out agent }
        shot.send_chunk(agent.card, agent.shot_bytes, packet, parse.parse_size(str.slice(packet.text, str.bytes(SHOT_PREFIX), str.bytes(packet.text))))
        out agent
    }
    ((packet.text == "shot") == no) { wake(agent) }
    @who = net.ip_text(packet.from_ip)
    @command = packet.text
    log(agent, "command from {who}: {command}")
    feed.show_command(agent, who, packet.payload)
    netlog.ask(agent.card.base, packet.payload)
    @reply_bytes = []
    (mrpc.is_request(packet.payload) == yes) { reply_bytes = mrpc_reply(agent, packet) }
    (mrpc.is_request(packet.payload) == no) {
        @said = execute(agent, command, packet.payload) rescue |err| { "ошибка: {err}" }
        reply_bytes = feed.text_bytes(said, REPLY_LIMIT)
        (group.count(agent.output) > 0) { reply_bytes = group.concat(group.add(reply_bytes, 10), agent.output) }
        agent.output = []
        (group.count(reply_bytes) > REPLY_LIMIT) { reply_bytes = group.slice(reply_bytes, 0, REPLY_LIMIT) }
    }
    feed.show_reply(agent, reply_bytes)
    netlog.say(agent.card.base, reply_bytes)
    @frame = net.udp_frame_bytes(our_mac(agent), my_ip(agent), packet.from_mac, packet.from_ip, PORT, packet.from_port, reply_bytes)
    @sent = transmit(agent, frame)
    log(agent, "  replied {sent} bytes")
    agent.commands = agent.commands + 1
    ((agent.opening == "") == no) {
        agent.opening = ""
        open_program(agent) rescue |err| { feed.show_reply(agent, feed.text_bytes("не открылась: {err}", 200)) }
    }
    (agent.restart == yes) {
        countdown(agent, COUNTDOWN)
        uefi.restart(agent.card.base)
    }
    out agent
}

skill draw_progress(agent) {
    (agent.console == yes) { out none }
    (agent.lent == yes) { out none }
    out feed.draw_progress(agent)
}

skill store_chunk(agent, bytes) {
    @offset = net.word(bytes, 42) * 65536 + net.word(bytes, 44)
    @size = net.word(bytes, 38) - 12
    (size > group.count(bytes) - 46) { size = group.count(bytes) - 46 }
    (agent.expected > 0) {
        (offset == agent.received) {
            (offset + size > agent.expected) { size = agent.expected - offset }
            drum (size) {
                @value = group.get(bytes, 46 + beat)
                firmware.write8(agent.bay, agent.card.base, offset + beat, value)
                agent.total = num.mod(agent.total + value, 65536)
            }
            agent.received = offset + size
            (num.mod(agent.received, REPORT_EVERY) < size) {
                @received = agent.received
                @expected = agent.expected
                log(agent, "upload: {received} of {expected} bytes")
                draw_progress(agent)
            }
            (agent.received == agent.expected) { draw_progress(agent) }
        }
    }
    @said = "ok {agent.received}"
    @to_mac = net.slice_bytes(bytes, 6, 6)
    @to_ip = net.slice_bytes(bytes, 26, 4)
    transmit(agent, net.udp_frame(our_mac(agent), my_ip(agent), to_mac, to_ip, DATA_PORT, net.word(bytes, 34), said))
    out agent
}

skill handle(agent, bytes) {
    agent.frames = agent.frames + 1
    (agent.via == "wifi") {
        traffic.answer_arp(agent.wifi, agent.wifi.point, bytes)
        (net.is_udp_to(bytes, PORT) == yes) { out answer(agent, bytes) }
        (net.is_udp_to(bytes, DATA_PORT) == yes) { out store_chunk(agent, bytes) }
        out agent
    }
    (net.is_arp_request_for(bytes, MY_IP) == yes) {
        transmit(agent, net.arp_reply(agent.card.mac, MY_IP, bytes))
        agent.arp = agent.arp + 1
        @asker = net.ip_text(net.slice_bytes(bytes, 28, 4))
        log(agent, "arp: told {asker} that 10.0.0.2 is us")
        out agent
    }
    (net.is_udp_to(bytes, PORT) == yes) { out answer(agent, bytes) }
    (net.is_udp_to(bytes, DATA_PORT) == yes) { out store_chunk(agent, bytes) }
    out agent
}

skill my_ip(agent) {
    (agent.via == "wifi") { out agent.wifi.ip }
    out MY_IP
}

skill our_mac(agent) {
    (agent.via == "wifi") { out agent.wifi.mac }
    out agent.card.mac
}

skill wifi_line(agent) {
    (agent.wifi == none) { out agent.wifi_text }
    @damaged = agent.wifi.frames_damaged
    out "{agent.wifi_text}, испорченных кадров выброшено {damaged}"
}

skill wifi_address(agent) {
    out net.ip_text(agent.wifi.ip)
}

skill transmit(agent, frame) {
    (agent.via == "wifi") {
        traffic.send(agent.wifi, agent.wifi.point, frame)
        out group.count(frame)
    }
    out rtl8111.send(agent.card, frame)
}

skill wifi_keep(agent) {
    (agent.expected == 0) { out "сначала upload посылки (tools/wifi_pack.py)" }
    ((agent.received == agent.expected) == no) { out str.concat("приём не закончен: ", upload_state(agent)) }
    @written = programs.keep_file(agent.card.base, agent.bay, agent.expected, WIFI_FOLDER, WIFI_FILE)
    out "сохранил прошивку Wi-Fi: {written} байт в \\SALTIC\\{WIFI_FOLDER}\\{WIFI_FILE}"
}

skill wifi_up(agent, name) {
    @started = day_second(agent.card.base)
    agent.wifi = none
    agent.wifi_text = "поднимаю"
    agent.expected = 0
    take_bay(agent, WIFI_ROOM)
    @size = programs.load_file(agent.card.base, "{WIFI_FOLDER}\\{WIFI_FILE}", agent.bay, WIFI_ROOM) rescue |err| {
        agent.wifi_text = "нет прошивки на диске"
        out "Wi-Fi: нет прошивки на диске ({err}); залей посылку и скажи wifi-keep"
    }
    @chip = qca9377.open()
    @told = qca9377.bring_up(chip, agent.bay, name) rescue |err| {
        qca9377.quiet(chip)
        agent.wifi_text = "ошибка: {err}"
        out "Wi-Fi: ошибка {err}"
    }
    @took = day_second(agent.card.base) - started
    (chip.point == none) {
        qca9377.quiet(chip)
        agent.wifi_text = "не подключился"
        out "Wi-Fi «{name}» не поднялся за {took} с: {told}"
    }
    agent.wifi = chip
    @address = net.ip_text(chip.ip)
    agent.wifi_text = "{address} в «{name}»"
    agent.via = "wifi"
    transmit(agent, net.udp_frame(chip.mac, chip.ip, net.BROADCAST_MAC, [255, 255, 255, 255], PORT, PORT, "агент Saltic {VERSION} слушает {address}:5555 по Wi-Fi"))
    agent.via = "cable"
    out "Wi-Fi: {address} в «{name}» за {took} с ({size} байт прошивки)"
}

skill poll_wifi(agent) {
    (agent.wifi == none) { out none }
    drum (WIFI_FRAMES) {
        @bytes = traffic.poll(agent.wifi)
        (bytes == none) { leave }
        agent.via = "wifi"
        handle(agent, bytes) rescue |err| {
            agent.via = "cable"
            out none
        }
        agent.via = "cable"
    }
    out none
}

skill has_link(card) {
    out rtl8111.has_bit(rtl8111.status(card), rtl8111.PHY_LINK)
}

skill greet(card) {
    rtl8111.send(card, net.udp_frame(card.mac, MY_IP, net.BROADCAST_MAC, [255, 255, 255, 255], PORT, PORT, "агент Saltic {VERSION} слушает 10.0.0.2:5555, скажи help"))
    out none
}

skill watch_link(agent) {
    @now = has_link(agent.card)
    (now == agent.linked) { out none }
    agent.linked = now
    (now == yes) {
        log(agent, "link: cable is back, listening")
        greet(agent.card)
        out none
    }
    log(agent, "link: cable lost, waiting")
    feed.banner(agent.card.base, "нет связи по кабелю — агент работает и ждёт")
    out none
}

skill tick(agent) {
    drum (rtl8111.RX_COUNT) {
        (rtl8111.received(agent.card, beat) == yes) {
            @bytes = rtl8111.read_frame(agent.card, beat)
            rtl8111.release(agent.card, beat)
            handle(agent, bytes)
        }
    }
    agent.rounds = agent.rounds + 1
    (num.mod(agent.rounds, WIFI_EVERY) == 0) { poll_wifi(agent) }
    (num.mod(agent.rounds, KEY_EVERY) == 0) { press(agent, uefi.poll_key(agent.card.base, 0)) }
    (agent.rounds == CLOCK_EVERY) {
        agent.rounds = 0
        watch_link(agent)
        (agent.console == no) {
            (agent.saver == no) {
                (agent.lent == no) { feed.draw_clock(agent) }
                doze(agent)
            }
            system_panel.tick(agent.card.base, agent.card, system_panel.Meter {}) rescue |err| { none }
        }
    }
    out none
}

skill last_cry(card, message) {
    feed.banner(card.base, message)
    (has_link(card) == no) { out none }
    rtl8111.send(card, net.udp_frame(card.mac, MY_IP, net.BROADCAST_MAC, [255, 255, 255, 255], PORT, PORT, message))
    out none
}

skill survive(agent) {
    tick(agent) rescue |err| {
        agent.failures = agent.failures + 1
        agent.last_error = "{err}"
        feed.banner(agent.card.base, "сбой в цикле: {err} (агент продолжает работу)")
        none
    }
    out none
}

skill serve(agent) {
    always { survive(agent) }
    out agent
}

skill run() {
    @screen = uefi.wide_console(firmware.guest_base())
    @columns = screen.columns
    @rows = screen.rows
    io.show("Saltic agent: screen {columns} x {rows} characters")
    @card = rtl8111.open()
    @mac = net.mac_text(card.mac)
    io.show("[1] card {mac}")
    rtl8111.configure(card)
    io.show("[2] card configured, waiting for link...")
    @link = rtl8111.wait_link(card) rescue |err| { "none yet: agent keeps running and waits for the cable" }
    io.show("[3] link {link}")
    @linked = has_link(card)
    (linked == yes) { greet(card) }
    io.show("[4] listening on 10.0.0.2:5555 (arp + udp commands)")
    @regions = arena_map.check()
    @arena_used = arena_map.used()
    io.show("[5] arena map: {regions} regions, {arena_used} bytes, no overlap")
    io.show("")
    @bay = firmware.region(card.base, "bay")
    io.show("[6] upload bay taken per upload, limit {UPLOAD_LIMIT} bytes")
    @agent = Agent { card = card, columns = columns, rows = rows, bay = bay, limit = UPLOAD_LIMIT, linked = linked }
    agent.active_at = day_second(card.base)
    system_panel.measure_disk(card.base) rescue |err| { none }
    io.show("[7] Wi-Fi: firmware from disk, open network «{WIFI_NETWORK}» ...")
    wifi_up(agent, WIFI_NETWORK) rescue |err| { none }
    (agent.wifi == none) { io.show("    Wi-Fi is not up (say wifi for details)") }
    ((agent.wifi == none) == no) {
        @address = wifi_address(agent)
        io.show("    Wi-Fi up: {address}:5555")
    }
    clear_screen(agent)
    netlog.say_text(card.base, "агент Saltic {VERSION} слушает 10.0.0.2:5555")
    serve(agent) rescue |err| {
        last_cry(card, "агент остановился: {err}")
        out err
    }
    last_cry(card, "агент остановился: главный цикл закончился")
    out none
}

program() {
    io.show("Saltic agent: commands over the network")
    @done = run() rescue |err| {
        io.show("FAILED: ", err)
        feed.banner(firmware.guest_base(), "агент не запустился: {err}") rescue |again| { none }
        none
    }
    io.show("")
    io.show("This program never exits. Turn the laptop off when done.")
    drum (200000000) {
        @key = io.key()
    }
}
